        {
          "t": "prose",
          "markdown": "Each line is the edge of the one enemy,\n[losing your thread](../blueprint/vision.md#the-enemy-losing-your-thread): a stack that replaced you, produced for its own sake, kept your context in someone else's place,\nlocked you to one vendor or worked in someone else's style would be a stack you are not the\nauthor of.",
